description=Per-game performance profile for Xiaomi Mi 9T (davinci). Raises CPU big-cluster/GPU/DDR floors (no overclock), speeds up big-core migration and top-app scheduling, and enables the hardware touch game mode when a game is in the foreground; reverts on exit. Edit games.txt to choose which apps trigger it.
